<!doctype html>
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
{% set aditionalFields = contactus.getAditionalFields() %}
<head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
    <title>Ford | Vehiculos</title>
    <style type="text/css">
        *{
            text-decoration: none;
            font-family: sans-serif;
            color: #2E2D34;
            font-weight: normal;
        }

        p{
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .ReadMsgBody{
            width: 100%;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }

        .ExternalClass{
            width: 100%;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }

        body{
            width: 100%;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            margin:0; padding:0;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            font-family: 'Roboto', 'Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif
        }

        table{
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        @media only screen and (max-width: 640px)  {
            .deviceWidth{
                width:440px!important;
                padding:0;
            }
            .center{
                text-align: center!important;
            }
        }

        @media only screen and (max-width: 479px) {
            .deviceWidth{
                width: 100% !important;
                padding:0;
            }
            .center{
                text-align: center!important;
            }
            .wspacing{
                width: 30px;
            }
            .logo_e{
                max-width: 136px;
                width: 100%;
                padding-right: 20px;
                display: block;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body leftmargin="0" topmargin="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" style="font-family: 'Roboto','Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif" >
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center">
    <tr>
        <td width="100%" valign="top" bgcolor="#f3f3f3" style="padding-top:0px">
            <table width="620" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" class="deviceWidth" style="margin:0 auto;">
                <tr>
                    <td width="100%" bgcolor="#2E2D34">
                        <table border="0" cellpadding="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" align="center" class="deviceWidth">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding:6px 20px" class="center" align="center">

                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <table width="620" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" class="deviceWidth" style="margin:0 auto;">
                <tr>
                    <td class="wspacing" width="70px" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                    <td bgcolor="#ffffff" style="border-bottom: 2px solid #eeeeee;">
                        <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="left" class="">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding:30px 20px 30px 0px" class="left">
                                    <a href="#"><img src="{{ server_url }}/img/email/logo-ford.png" alt="" border="0" width="103" height="40" /></a>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                        <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="right" class="">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding:30px 0px 30px 20px" class="right">
                                    <a href="#"><img src="{{ server_url }}/img/email/logo_purdy_motor.png" alt="" border="0" /></a>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                    <td class="wspacing" width="70px" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <table width="620" class="deviceWidth" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" bgcolor="#eeeeed" style="margin:0 auto;">
                <tr>
                    <td class="wspacing" width="70px" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                    <td valign="top" style="padding:0" bgcolor="#ffffff">
                        <h1 style="font-size: 24px;color: #05629D;font-weight: bold;">Hola, {{ contactus.getFirstName() }} {{ contactus.getLastName() }}</h1>
                        <h3 style="font-size: 20px;">Gracias por tu interés en nuestros vehículos</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px;">Nos enorgullece que nos hagas parte de esta importante decisión. Por ello, te aseguramos que nos esmeraremos para que tu experiencia de compra sea lo más placentera, a la par de la calidad indiscutible de los mejores vehículos del mercado, los de FORD.</p>
                        <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 25px;">Un Asesor de Ventas te contactará muy pronto para dar seguimiento a tu solicitud de reserva.</p>
                    </td>
                    <td class="wspacing" width="70px" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <table width="620" class="deviceWidth" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" bgcolor="#eeeeed" style="margin:0 auto;">
                <tr>
                    <td class="wspacing" width="70px" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                    <td bgcolor="#ffffff">
                        <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="left" class="">
                            <tr>
                                <td width="100%" bgcolor="#ffffff">
                                    <h2 style="font-size: 24px;">Resumen de Cotización para <strong style="font-weight: bold;">{{ contactus.getFamily().getName() }}</strong>*</h2>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                    <td class="wspacing" width="70px" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="wspacing" width="70px" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                    <td width="" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="border-bottom: 2px solid #eeeeee;">
                        <table border="0" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="left" class="">
                            <tr>
                                <td valign="top" style="padding:0" bgcolor="#ffffff">
                                    <h2 style="font-size: 16px;"><strong style="font-weight: bold;">Modelo</strong></h2>
                                    <p>{{ contactus.getModel().getName() }}</p>
                                </td>
                                <td valign="bottom" style="padding:0" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="35%">
                                    <p>${{ aditionalFields["price"] | number_format(0,",",".")}}</p>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                    <td class="wspacing" width="70px" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                </tr>
                {% if 0 < (aditionalFields["accesories"] | length) %}
                <tr>
                    <td class="wspacing" width="70px" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                    <td bgcolor="#ffffff" style="border-bottom: 2px solid #eeeeee;">
                        <table border="0" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="left" class="">
                            <tr>
                                <td valign="top" style="padding:0" bgcolor="#ffffff">
                                    <h2 style="font-size: 16px;"><strong style="font-weight: bold;">Accesorios</strong></h2>
                                </td>
                                <td valign="bottom" style="padding:0" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="35%">

                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            {% for accesory in aditionalFields["accesories"] %}
                            <tr>
                                <td valign="top" style="padding:0" bgcolor="#ffffff">
                                    <p>{{ accesory["name"] }}</p>
                                </td>
                                <td valign="bottom" style="padding:0" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="35%">
                                    <p>${{ accesory["price"] | number_format(0,",",".") }}</p>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </table>
                    </td>
                    <td class="wspacing" width="70px" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                </tr>
                {% endif %}
                {% if 0 < (aditionalFields["maintenance"] | length) %}
                    <tr>
                        <td class="wspacing" width="70px" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                        <td bgcolor="#ffffff" style="border-bottom: 2px solid #eeeeee;">
                            <table border="0" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="left" class="">
                                <tr>
                                    <td valign="top" style="padding:0" bgcolor="#ffffff">
                                        <h2 style="font-size: 16px;"><strong style="font-weight: bold;">Plan de Mantenimiento</strong></h2>
                                    </td>
                                    <td valign="bottom" style="padding:0" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="35%">

                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                {% for plan in aditionalFields["maintenance"] %}
                                    <tr>
                                        <td valign="top" style="padding:0" bgcolor="#ffffff">
                                            <p>{{ plan["tittle"] }}</p>
                                        </td>
                                        <td valign="bottom" style="padding:0" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="35%">
                                            <p>${{ plan["price"] | number_format(0,",",".") }}</p>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </table>
                        </td>
                        <td class="wspacing" width="70px" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                    </tr>
                {% endif %}
                {% if 0 < (aditionalFields["insurance"] | length) %}
                    <tr>
                        <td class="wspacing" width="70px" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                        <td bgcolor="#ffffff" style="border-bottom: 2px solid #eeeeee;">
                            <table border="0" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="left" class="">
                                <tr>
                                    <td valign="top" style="padding:0" bgcolor="#ffffff">
                                        <h2 style="font-size: 16px;"><strong style="font-weight: bold;">Seguro (Cobro Mensual)</strong></h2>
                                    </td>
                                    <td valign="bottom" style="padding:0" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="35%">

                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                {% for plan in aditionalFields["insurance"] %}
                                    <tr>
                                        <td valign="top" style="padding:0" bgcolor="#ffffff">
                                            <p>{{ plan["tittle"] }}</p>
                                        </td>
                                        <td valign="bottom" style="padding:0" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="35%">
                                            <p>${{ plan["price"] | number_format(0,",",".") }}</p>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </table>
                        </td>
                        <td class="wspacing" width="70px" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                    </tr>
                {% endif %}
                <tr>
                    <td class="wspacing" width="70px" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                    <td width="" bgcolor="#ffffff">
                        <table border="0" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="right" class="">
                            <tr>
                                <td valign="top" style="padding:0" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                                <td valign="top" style="padding:0" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="35%" align="">
                                    <p>TOTAL: <strong style="font-size: 16px;color: #05629D;font-weight: bold;">${{ aditionalFields["total"] | number_format(0,",",".") }}</strong></p>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                    <td class="wspacing" width="70px" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                </tr>
            </table>
            {% include "@LumenApp/Email/partials/financiamientos.html.twig" %}
            <table width="620" class="deviceWidth" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" bgcolor="#eeeeed" style="margin:0 auto;">
                <tr>
                    <td class="wspacing" width="70px" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                    <td valign="top" style="padding:0" bgcolor="#ffffff">
                        <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center">
                            <tr>
                                <td>
                                    <div style="height:20px;margin:0 auto;">&nbsp;</div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td align="center">
                                    <table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td align="center" width="300px" height="40px" style="-webkit-border-radius: 3px; -moz-border-radius: 3px; border-radius: 3px;" bgcolor="#05629D">
                                                <a href="mailto:ventas@grupopurdy.com" style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; text-decoration: none; -webkit-border-radius: 3px; -moz-border-radius: 3px; border-radius: 3px; padding: 16px; display: inline-block;">CONTACTANOS</a>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>
                                    <div style="height:35px;margin:0 auto;">&nbsp;</div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                    <td class="wspacing" width="70px" bgcolor="#ffffff"></td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center">
                <tr>
                    <td bgcolor="#f3f3f3" style="padding:0 0 60px 0">
                        <table width="580" border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" align="center" class="deviceWidth" style="margin:0 auto;">
                            <tr>
                                <td>
                                    <table width="50%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"  border="0" align="center" class="deviceWidth">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td valign="top" style="font-size: 11px; color: #f1f1f1; font-weight: normal; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif; line-height: 26px; vertical-align: top; text-align:right" class="center">
                                                <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;">SEGUINOS EN:</p>
                                                <a href="https://www.facebook.com/FordCostaRica" style="display: inline-block; margin-right: 35px;"><img src="{{ server_url }}/img/email/facebook.png" width="25" height="24" alt="Facebook" title="Facebook" border="0" /></a>
                                                <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC9dvZm4Gt1ggI428hfulSDQ" style="display: inline-block; margin-right: 35px;"><img src="{{ server_url }}/img/email/youtube.png" width="25" height="24" alt="Youtube" title="Youtube" border="0" /></a>
                                                <a href="https://www.instagram.com/fordcostarica/" style="display: inline-block; margin-right: 35px;"><img src="{{ server_url }}/img/email/instagram.png" width="25" height="24" alt="Instagram" title="Instagram" border="0" /></a>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>

<div style="display:none; white-space:nowrap; font:15px courier; color:#ffffff;">- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</div>
</body>
</html>
